WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.600
Every day, many Sikhs recite
a hymn with a striking line:

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.530
you have been given this human body.

3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:13.350
Sikh teaching speaks of 8.4 million
life forms that a soul may pass through.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.090
Out of all of them, being born
human is rare and precious.

5
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:22.090
So why do Sikhs call being
born human a rare chance?

6
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.840
And what should you do with it?

7
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.640
In this mission, you'll explore
the Sikh picture of a person:

8
00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.810
body, mind and soul.

9
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.810
Then you'll meet the virtues
Sikhs try to grow in,

10
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.930
like truth and humility.

11
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.610
Your mission: find out why a human
life matters so much to Sikhs,

12
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.830
and how they use it.
